plies to WhatsApp, email and SMS enquiries in minutes, qualifies budget, timeline and fit, scores every lead, and runs broadcasts, automation and voice calling.\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"AI marketing automation India,AI outreach agent,GTM for startups,WhatsApp sales automation,AI sales agent SMB India\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://nebulaa.ai\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Pulsar — AI Outreach &amp; Lead Qualification Agent | Nebulaa\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Pulsar replies to WhatsApp, email and SMS enquiries in minutes, qualifies budget, timeline and fit, scores every lead, and runs broadcasts, automation and voice calling.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@nebulaaai\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Nebulaa.ai — AI Marketing &amp; Outreach for Founders\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Two AI agents. Your entire GTM. Automated.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,500;1,600&amp;family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Nebulaa\",\"legalName\":\"Noburo Business Services LLP\",\"url\":\"https://nebulaa.ai\",\"email\":\"hello@nebulaa.ai\",\"description\":\"Nebulaa is a Chennai-based AI marketing company. It builds two agents — Gravity for marketing and Pulsar for outreach — and runs managed marketing engagements for brands across South India.\",\"foundingDate\":\"2025\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Chennai\",\"addressRegion\":\"Tamil Nadu\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Country\",\"name\":\"India\"},\"makesOffer\":[{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"name\":\"Gravity\",\"price\":\"10000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Gravity\",\"description\":\"Reads a website and builds a marketing strategy from it, plans the month, drafts posts, carousels and reels, tracks competitors, runs campaigns and creator collaborations, and handles the social inbox.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"name\":\"Pulsar\",\"price\":\"15000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Pulsar\",\"description\":\"Answers enquiries on WhatsApp, email and SMS within minutes, qualifies budget, timeline and fit, scores every lead, and runs broadcasts, automation and voice calling.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"name\":\"Both agents\",\"price\":\"20000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Both agents\",\"description\":\"Gravity and Pulsar on one account, sharing the same brand memory.\"}}]}</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"bg-ground text-ink font-body antialiased\"><nav class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 border-b border-rule transition-all duration-300 bg-ground/80 backdrop-blur-sm\" style=\"transform:translateY(-64px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between py-7 px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px]\"><a class=\"flex-shrink-0\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Nebulaa.ai\" fetchPriority=\"high\" loading=\"eager\" width=\"160\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-10 w-auto hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity dark:hidden\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-light.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-light.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-light.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75\"/><img alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fetchPriority=\"high\" loading=\"eager\" width=\"160\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-10 w-auto hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity brightness-110 hidden dark:block\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-dark.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-dark.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-dark.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75\"/></a><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-[38px]\"><div class=\"relative\"><button class=\"flex items-center gap-1 font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Product<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><a class=\"relative font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors group\" href=\"/channels\">Channels<span class=\"absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 w-0 h-px bg-gold group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300\"></span></a><a class=\"relative font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors group\" href=\"/services\">Services<span class=\"absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 w-0 h-px bg-gold group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300\"></span></a><a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"relative font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors group\">Pricing<span class=\"absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 w-0 h-px bg-gold group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300\"></span></a><div class=\"relative\"><button class=\"flex items-center gap-1 font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Resources<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-3.5\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Sign in</a><a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"font-body text-sm font-semibold bg-brand-gold text-brand-black rounded-full px-[22px] py-[11px] shadow-[0_4px_18px_rgba(245,166,35,0.20)] hover:bg-brand-gold-dim transition-all\">Start free</a></div><div class=\"md:hidden flex items-center gap-2\"><button class=\"text-ink\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></nav><main class=\"bg-ground text-ink min-h-screen\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Product\",\"item\":\"https://nebulaa.ai/product\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Pulsar\",\"item\":\"https://nebulaa.ai/product/pulsar\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Pulsar\",\"description\":\"Pulsar replies to WhatsApp, email and SMS enquiries in minutes, qualifies budget, timeline and fit, scores every lead, and runs broadcasts, automation and voice calling.\",\"applicationCategory\":\"BusinessApplication\",\"operatingSystem\":\"Web\",\"url\":\"https://nebulaa.ai/product/pulsar\",\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"15000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\"}}</script><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] pt-[130px] pb-[80px]\"><nav class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[12.5px] text-faint mb-8\"><a class=\"hover:text-gold-text\" href=\"/product\">Product</a><span>/</span><span class=\"text-muted\">Pulsar</span></nav><div class=\"max-w-[880px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[24px] block\">Pulsar — the outreach agent</span><h1 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[40px] md:text-[62px] leading-[1.06] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-[26px]\" style=\"text-wrap:pretty\">Whoever replies first<!-- --> <span class=\"italic text-gold-display\">wins the sale.</span></h1><p class=\"text-[18px] leading-[1.65] text-muted max-w-[660px] mb-9\">Pulsar answers every enquiry on WhatsApp, email and SMS within minutes, asks the questions you would have asked, scores what comes back, and hands you only the people worth your afternoon. Broadcasts, automation and voice calling run from the same place.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gold text-[#1A1208] text-[15px] font-semibold px-[30px] py-[15px] rounded-full hover:brightness-105 transition\" href=\"/pricing\">Start free trial <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><span class=\"text-[14.5px] text-muted\">₹15,000 / month<!-- --> · 7-day trial, no card</span></div></div></section><hr class=\"border-t border-rule\"/><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[110px]\"><div class=\"max-w-[660px] mb-[56px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[20px] block\">Everything it does</span><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[32px] md:text-[46px] leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-5\">10<!-- --> things, <span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">not one.</span></h2><p class=\"text-[16px] leading-[1.68] text-muted\">Most of what <!-- -->Pulsar<!-- --> does has never been on this website. Each of these is a module that ships in the product today.</p></div><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5\"><a class=\"group block bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] px-[28px] pt-[30px] pb-7 hover:border-gold/30 transition-colors\" href=\"/product/pulsar/whatsapp\"><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[20px] mb-2.5\">WhatsApp</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-5\">Replies to WhatsApp enquiries in minutes, in your voice.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group block bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] px-[28px] pt-[30px] pb-7 hover:border-gold/30 transition-colors\" href=\"/product/pulsar/leads\"><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[20px] mb-2.5\">Leads &amp; scoring</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-5\">Every conversation scored on intent, so the list is already ordered.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group block bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] px-[28px] pt-[30px] pb-7 hover:border-gold/30 transition-colors\" href=\"/product/pulsar/broadcasts\"><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[20px] mb-2.5\">Broadcasts</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-5\">Segment, send, and handle every reply as a conversation.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group block bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] px-[28px] pt-[30px] pb-7 hover:border-gold/30 transition-colors\" href=\"/product/pulsar/voice-calling\"><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[20px] mb-2.5\">Voice calling</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-5\">A call queue for the enquiries where a message is not enough.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group block bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] px-[28px] pt-[30px] pb-7 hover:border-gold/30 transition-colors\" href=\"/product/pulsar/ai-agents\"><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[20px] mb-2.5\">AI agents</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-5\">Separate agents per conversation type, each with its own brief and tone.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group block bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] px-[28px] pt-[30px] pb-7 hover:border-gold/30 transition-colors\" href=\"/product/pulsar/automation\"><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[20px] mb-2.5\">Automation</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-5\">Follow-up sequences that run themselves, with a live monitor.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group block bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] px-[28px] pt-[30px] pb-7 hover:border-gold/30 transition-colors\" href=\"/product/pulsar/knowledge-base\"><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[20px] mb-2.5\">Knowledge base</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-5\">Your products, policies and answers — the boundary it works inside.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group block bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] px-[28px] pt-[30px] pb-7 hover:border-gold/30 transition-colors\" href=\"/product/pulsar/email-sms\"><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[20px] mb-2.5\">Email &amp; SMS</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-5\">Email and SMS alongside WhatsApp, in one conversation thread.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group block bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] px-[28px] pt-[30px] pb-7 hover:border-gold/30 transition-colors\" href=\"/product/pulsar/tasks-activities\"><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[20px] mb-2.5\">Tasks &amp; activities</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-5\">Named owners, dated follow-ups, and a trail of what actually happened.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group block bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] px-[28px] pt-[30px] pb-7 hover:border-gold/30 transition-colors\" href=\"/product/pulsar/analytics\"><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[20px] mb-2.5\">Analytics</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-5\">Response time, conversion and per-person performance.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div></section><hr class=\"border-t border-rule\"/><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[100px]\"><div class=\"bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[20px] px-8 md:px-[52px] py-[46px] max-w-[880px]\"><span class=\"neb-label  mb-4 block\">The other half</span><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[26px] md:text-[34px] leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-4\">Pulsar<!-- --> brings people in. <!-- -->Gravity<!-- --> <!-- -->gives them a reason to come.</h2><p class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.68] text-muted mb-7 max-w-[62ch]\">Gravity reads your website, builds a strategy from it, plans the month, drafts every post, carousel and reel to fill that month, and waits for you to tap approve. It also runs your campaigns, your creator collaborations, your inbox and your SEO — most of which nobody realises it does.</p><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[14.5px] font-semibold text-gold-text hover:gap-3 transition-all\" href=\"/product/gravity\">See <!-- -->Gravity<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></section></main><footer class=\"relative border-t border-rule pt-[60px] pb-[50px] px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start justify-between gap-[50px] lg:gap-[70px]\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-[10px] mb-4\"><div class=\"w-[17px] h-[17px] rounded-full flex-shrink-0\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle at 34% 32%, #FFD48A 0%, #F5A623 46%, #A4650B 100%)\"></div><span class=\"font-heading text-[17px] font-normal text-ink\">Nebulaa</span></div><div class=\"font-body text-[13px] text-muted leading-[1.7]\">Chennai, India<br/><a href=\"mailto:hello@nebulaa.ai\" class=\"hover:text-gold-text transition-colors\">hello@nebulaa.ai</a></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-[70px] gap-y-[40px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-[11px]\"><span class=\"neb-label  mb-1\">Product</span><a href=\"/product\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Overview</a><a href=\"/product/gravity\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Gravity</a><a href=\"/product/pulsar\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Pulsar</a><a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Pricing</a></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-[11px]\"><span class=\"neb-label  mb-1\">Services</span><a href=\"/services\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Managed services</a><a href=\"/channels\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Channels</a><a href=\"/work\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Engagements</a><a href=\"/for\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">By industry</a></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-[11px]\"><span class=\"neb-label  mb-1\">Free</span><a href=\"/tools\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">30 free tools</a><a href=\"/resources\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Downloads</a><a href=\"/compare\" class=\"font-body text